  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa es mejorar la infraestructura fsica educativa en los planteles educativos elegibles donde se imparte la educacin bsica pblica en Mxico.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the program is to improve the educational physical infrastructure in eligible educational institutions where basic public education in Mexico is taught.</narrative>
  </description>
